{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34010","headline":"冬晓章上人院 · 皮日休","name":"冬晓章上人院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山堂冬晓寂无闻，一句清言忆领军。\n琥珀珠黏行处雪，椶榈箒扫卧来云。\n松扉欲啓如鸣鹤，石鼎初煎若聚蚊。\n不是恋师终去晚，陆机茸内足毛羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}